"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/544772/description_f080cedc-12ef-442e-a021-6d3f7353b8cc.png\" width=\"201\" height=\"73\"></a></span></p>\n<p><strong>传奇标签页</strong> 引入了一种使用物品栏标签页访问模组包菜单的全新自定义方式。此模组允许你通过配置文件轻松导航至任何已配置的菜单。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">当前已集成的标签页包括：&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Backpacked, Quark Oddities, FTB Quests, FTB Teams, Reskillable (Reimagined), Legendary Survival Overhaul, Map Atlases, Xaeros's map, Journey Map<br></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172469/description_c1b4cab4-6fe9-4600-ac62-8e65598df0fe.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本模组是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/minecraft-legendary-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\"><em>Minecraft Legendary Edition</em>&nbsp;模组包</a>&nbsp;的一部分！</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>建议游玩该模组包以获得最佳体验。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252flegendary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1172469/description_f7ab851d-34bd-4638-8f98-b1ee3bc857c6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"170\"></strong></a></p>",
